-- Phong Than 2026-10-03 (agent vantieu/vanluong): Van Luong + Van Tieu 2004, shared library.
-- ASCII file generated by scratchpad\vantieu\gen.py (Vietnamese = TCVN3 escapes, GBK paths = escapes).
-- Included by \script\phongthan\vanluong\vl_core.lua (dialog / timer / death script of carts, bandits and the
-- Luong Thao Quan) and by the VNG 2004 Van Tieu scripts patched in ptfix (extra_vanluong.py).
-- Engine side (CoreServer, PhongThanLuaCarriage.h): NewSiegeWeapon + SendCarriage turn the cart into a
-- kind 0 NPC of the owner's camp that walks after the owner (AiMode 12), death -> DeathSelf + Revive.
-- Without that engine build the cart is an AddNpc NPC moved by its 1-second Lua timer (SetNpcPos).
-- No Lua globals are shared between scripts: state lives in task values (owner) and NPC params (cart).
-- Tasks 2121-2133 (2120 and 2123 are left alone: a loose pet script writes them).

PTVL_SCRIPT = "\\script\\phongthan\\vanluong\\vl_core.lua"
